==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
*Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 33.33~53.33 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
There are two ways to beat the stage, either you spam meatshields and hit the Master A. duo with some [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance]] or [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attack]] cats, or you spam the likes of [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]], [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] to slowly chip away at their health.

